          "short": "$0.1\\dot{6}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{1}{6}&=1\\div6\\\\\\frac{1}{6}&=0.16666\\ldots\\\\\\frac{1}{6}&=0.1\\dot{6}\\end{align*}$$",
