        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$0.\\dot{2}8571\\dot{4}$",
          "worked": "Dividing 2 by 7 gives the repeating digits 285714; the remainder returns to 2 after six decimal places.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2}{7}&=0.285714285714\\ldots\\\\\\frac{2}{7}&=0.\\dot{2}8571\\dot{4}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 60
      },
